{"parse": {"title": "Love Star", "pageid": 2336, "revid": 12559, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Love Star</b>, added in <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log#Update_7_-_Black_Clover_Update_Part_1\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 10</a>, is a reward obtained from reaching Room 100 in the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Infinity Castle (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSW5maW5pdHlfQ2FzdGxlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Infinity Castle</span> (4th Season). \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Information\">Information</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span style=\"color:#FFC208;\">+Required to obtain a special unit...</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#921296;\"><i>\"Strength is beauty\"</i></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fc4242;\">This Star is sealed with a powerful magic and cannot be opened yet...</span> (Prior to Update 11)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"container&#95;ChBox\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(115px,1fr)); grid-auto-flow: row; justify-items: center; list-style-type: none; grid-row-gap: 13px; font-size: 18px;border-radius: 8px; background: #2e2e2e29; box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #94949480, inset 0 0 20px 0px #96969633; margin: 0; padding: 13px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Mythic)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Snake_Princess\" title=\"Snake Princess\"><img alt=\"Snake Princess\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/0/0a/Snake_Princess.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/101?cb=20250416204810\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"101\" height=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Snake Princess.png\" da